WEBVTT

00:12:25.236 --> 00:12:31.676
and find a community of friends and allies
who share the same dream.

00:12:32.436 --> 00:12:34.756
And with the insight of interbeing,

00:12:34.796 --> 00:12:39.876
we see that we're not a small me
realizing our dream,

00:12:39.916 --> 00:12:42.836
but a vast us.

00:12:43.836 --> 00:12:48.596
And we arrive at our destination

00:12:48.596 --> 00:12:50.636
in every step.

00:12:55.036 --> 00:12:57.596
So who am I?

00:12:59.436 --> 00:13:01.396
Where am I?